Package: maze
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Angelos Panagiotakis
Installed-Size: 32
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: bash (>= 3.2)
Homepage: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html
Description: simple auto-generated maze game for the terminal
 maze draws a freshly generated perfect maze in the terminal and lets you
 walk it with the arrow keys or WASD. Boards start small and grow one cell
 per direction each level; fog of war, hints, and a live HUD with moves,
 elapsed time and your best run are built in.
 .
 It is a single bash script with no dependencies beyond bash itself.
